# Keep fuzzing artifacts out of the Docker build context. None of these are
# COPYied into an image layer, but without this file `docker build fuzzing/`
# ships them to the daemon/remote builder on every rebuild — the grown corpus
# can be ~100 MB, and crash reproducers are private exploit primitives that must
# never leave the host. Mirror of .gitignore's runtime-artifact patterns.
persist/
crashes/
crashes_*/
corpus_*/
results/
out/
build/
artifacts/
*.log
*.o
*.a
